    <briefdescription>
<para>A flame graph merged from one or more <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1observability_1_1_node_profile" kindref="compound">NodeProfile</ref></computeroutput> objects. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The merged stacks are stored in the pprof folded-stacks text format (one stack per line, space-separated frames, followed by an aggregate sample count). Sample counts are summed across all contributing nodes.</para>
<para>Use <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1observability_1_1_merged_flame_graph_1aa671f7e6c36370ca12c19d7ded9857cc" kindref="member">toFoldedText()</ref></computeroutput> to obtain the merged profile as a string that can be consumed directly by:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>flamegraph.pl</computeroutput> (Brendan Gregg&apos;s FlameGraph toolkit)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>go tool pprof</computeroutput></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>async-profiler&apos;s collapsed output pipeline </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
